T* (balance; credit invoice aging is now calculated in South African days; and the hub sends same-day) Tj
T* (customer changes immediately. Alerts now show their full text with an Acknowledge button, and a new) Tj
T* (alert fires when a customer sync connection goes stale. At-risk customer detection in Insights is) Tj
T* (approximately 75× faster.) Tj
