(When a customer's balance was cleared by the nightly data sync rather than by an actual) Tj
T* (payment, Collections could mark the account as 'Paid in full'. The logic now correctly) Tj
T* (distinguishes a sync-cleared balance from a genuine receipt. Additionally, assignments are now) Tj
T* (closed when a customer is removed from Sage, so the worklist stays up to date.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (If your site ran v2026.5.14 before this update, check the System Log: it lists any assignments) Tj
T* (suspected of being affected. For each one, verify against Sage — if the customer is no longer) Tj
T* (there and no payment was received, reopen the assignment, add a note, and close it. No records) Tj
T* (were changed automatically.) Tj
